<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JAS" style="id">- Matengo Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Yakobu</para>
  <para style="toc1">Balua jaka Yakobu</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yakobu</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yako</para>
  <para style="mt2">Balua jejiandikwi na</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yakobu</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongulelu</para>
  <para style="ip">Kitabu sa Yakobu saandikwa na mundu jumu jobunkema Yakobu. Kuwesekana Yakobu jwabii ndongu waka Yesu, jojuwe jwabii kiongosi kati ja bandu ba bunhobaliya kilisitu pamwandi na jwabii mundu wa pasengo luku Yelusalemu mu lipungu la Mahengu 15:13. Ntumi pauli kabee jukema kipanda sa bandu ba bunhobale kilisitu lipungu la Agalatia 2:9. Asomi ahobale ana kitabu saka Yakobu kiandikwi mu yaka 50 badala jukubelekwa kilisitu. Ndaba Yakobu jwabii kiongosi wa bandu ba bunhobale kilisitu ku Yelusalemu, pangi jwaandika kitabu senze pa jutamika hoku.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yakobu jutuma kitabu saki “mumakabila komi na mabeli bapesangini nkati ju nndema” mu lipungu 1:1. Mapundisu gaka Yakobu gatumika kwa bandu boti ba bunhobale kilisitu, lakini pajutumi lolobi la makabila “komi na mabeli” galangi Yakobu jwaandika kijenda kwa bandu ba bunhobali kilisitu kuuyaudi. Ndaba kitabu senze sabi nama jakahiki asomi bingipi, kilongali majabu gingipi.Yakobu jubeka pamu kati ja kuhobale na mahengu. Kuhobale kwa sakaka kuilangiwa na mahengu mu lipungu 2:17. Kabee julangi kulekekewa kwa bandu babi na mali gingi, mu lipungu 2:1-4 na sutupagi kuba twa angalipu na se tupwaga, mu lipungu 3:1-12.</para>
  <para style="iot">Gagabii nkati:</para>
  <para style="io">Yakobu jaalamu asomi baki, linga mulipungu la 1:1.</para>
  <para style="io">Kabee jwahingamaki akilisitu kuba nganganga kipindi sa mang'aliku.</para>
  <para style="io">Kabee jupwaga kupalika kuhobale kulangiwa kupete mahengu, mu lipungu 2:1-26.</para>
  <para style="io">Badala ja apa jupwaga namuna malobi gana makili hegapalika kuba, mu lipungu 3:1-12.</para>
  <para style="io">Henu Yakobu julandi namuna hekima jaka sapanga hejibii ndali na Hekima ju nndema, mu lipungu 3:13-4:10.</para>
  <para style="io">Kabee jwalakali asomi baki bikipuna mu lipungu 4:11-5:6.</para>
  <para style="io">Yakobu jujomule kitabu saki mulipungu 5:7-20 sukupia malagalaki gukuhangangana.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JAS 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 1:1" />Nepani Yakobu ntumi waka Sapanga na waka Bambu witu Yesu Kilisitu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JAS 1:1">Nunhandaki balua mwanganya mwabandu ba makabila komi na mabeli ga gapesangini punndema. Ndenda kunndamu!<verse eid="JAS 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhobale na kuba na malangu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 1:2" />“Mwaalongu bangu, mtoguliya ngamaa pampatwa na milengu ndalindali, <verse eid="JAS 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 1:3" />ndaba mmanyiki ana kuhobale kwinu ana kubii nganganganga, kwanhenga nhinakaliya. <verse eid="JAS 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 1:4" />Mmbiya nu usakaka ndaba kuhinakali kwinu kwanzangatia mbiya nganganganga mbaka pamwisu ili nhwesa kuba mwabandu baakoliki na baajagani, banga kupongukewa na sindu sokapi. <verse eid="JAS 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 1:5" />Lakini ana jumu winu jupongukiwi malangu, ndienu, jupalika kunndoba Sapanga jojuwe jampekiya, ndaba Sapanga jaapeke boti su kujoloka na kwa mwoju wa sapi. <verse eid="JAS 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 1:6" />Lakini jupalika kuloba su kuhobale bila kuhola sokapi. Mundu jojubii ni kiholu jubii ngati majeba gu nhanga gagugee gakangwa nu nhwai koni na koni nu kugaleke. <verse eid="JAS 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 1:7" />Mundu ngati hoju jwiiholale jwiipata sindu sokapi kuhuma kwaka Bambu. <verse eid="JAS 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 1:8" />Jombi ndi mundu jojung'anambuka ng'anambuka, jwanga kuhobaleka mu indela yaki. Na ngasejuwesa kuamu sindu sejuhenga.”<verse eid="JAS 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mundu nhagu na mundu jwana mali gingi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 1:9" />“Ndongu jojubii jwanga nu ukolongu jupalika kutogule hali heji ndaba atei kunkwea, <verse eid="JAS 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 1:10" />najombi jwana mali gingi jupalika kutogule ndaba jukunhulu. Ndaba mundu jwana mali gingi jihoba kwi indela jeje ngati liua lu mu kiholi. <verse eid="JAS 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 1:11" />Liyoba palibala na lyotu laki lijomesa mimea, nagombi maua gaki gatenda kuhabuka, nu usapi waki woti gutenda kuhalabika. Ahelahela mundu jwana mali gingi bitenda kunhoa koni juendale na mahengu gaki.”<verse eid="JAS 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Milengu na mang'aliku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 1:12" />Jupengaliwi mundu jojuhendale kuhinakali mu milengu ndaba anajujomwi kuhinakali, jwiipata seketule ja womi jejuje Sapanga jaalagila bandu babumpala. <verse eid="JAS 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 1:13" />Ana mundu julengiwi kuhenga mahakau, jwiipwaga: “Ndenda kulegwa na Sapanga kuhenga mahakau.” Ndaba Sapanga ngasejuwesa kulegwa nu ubaja, wala jombi ngaseanndenga mundu jokapi kuhenga mahakau. <verse eid="JAS 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 1:14" />Lakini kila mundu julengwa pajuhutwa nu kujonzwa na ndokule yaki mweni iliya. <verse eid="JAS 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 1:15" />Ana ndokule jiliya jikomiki jileta mahakau, nagombi mahakau anagakomiki galeta kuwa.<verse eid="JAS 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 1:16" />Mwaalongu bangu monumpai, mwiikongeka! <verse eid="JAS 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 1:17" />Kila kipaji sa amboni na kila nhupi jejitosani ihuma kunani kwaka Sapanga, ihuma kwa Atati baabombiki unang'anu, jojuwe ngasejung'anambuka wala ngasejulangi nginyuli jokapi jukung'anambuka. <verse eid="JAS 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 1:18" />Sukupala kwaki mweni jutubelika kabee ku lilobi laki lu usakaka, ili tubiya mu napwasi ju utumbuli kati ji iumbi yaki.<verse eid="JAS 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kujoane nu kuhenga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 1:19" />Mwaalongu bangu monumpai nkombuka lijambu lende: Kila mundu jubiya ni kipyau sukujoane lakini jwikuba ni kipyau su kulonge. <verse eid="JAS 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 1:20" />Jojubii ni inyela ngasejuwesa kuhenga majambu ga amboni gajupala Sapanga. <verse eid="JAS 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JAS 1:21" />Henu nkotuka kuyobale kwiliya na mahengu goti giliya, mlibeka pai jaka Sapanga nu kujopa lilobi lebilipandiki mu mioju jinu, lelule liwesa kuokoa mioju jino.<verse eid="JAS 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JAS 1:22" />Mwalikonga mwabeti sukujoane pe lilobe laki, ila nhenga kwa mahengu. <verse eid="JAS 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JAS 1:23" />Jokapi jojujoane lilobi heli lakini ngasejuhenga, hoju jubii ngati mundu jojulingali sula jaki mweni mu liloli. <verse eid="JAS 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JAS 1:24" />Pajujomule kulilinga mweni juboka na papa jujijewa sula jaki ejubii. <verse eid="JAS 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JAS 1:25" />Lakini mundu jojijilingali sapi malagalaki gagatosani gagaaleka bandu abiya baalekakiwi, najuendale kugahenge mahengu sanga kujoa pena nukujewa, mundu we hoju jwipengaliwa mu hindu yoti yejuhenga.<verse eid="JAS 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JAS 1:26" />Ana mundu jilibona juwesa kundumbali Sapanga ngati ejupala, lakini ngasejuwesa kulongo lulimi lwaki, kundumbali Sapanga hoku ngasekunzangati sindu sokapi, kabee jilikonga mweni. <verse eid="JAS 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JAS 1:27" />Kundumbali Sapanga kokubii sapi na kwanga usapu palongi jaki: Kwajangati bana banga na atati na amabu na aka mbomba baawii alomi bandu majambu ga bagapala, na kulilonda beni ili bisapuka mu mahengu ganga kupalika pani pu nndema.<verse eid="JAS 1:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JAS 2" />
  <para style="s">Kukananaki ubagusi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 2:1" />Mwaalongu bangu, ana munhobali Bambu Yesu Kilisitu, Bambu ju ulumbi mwaabagu bandu hata kulenga. <verse eid="JAS 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 2:2" />Tupwaaga mundu jumu jojuweti peti ja zaabu ni ingobu ya sapi jujingi munyumba jukuketangane na papa jujingi mundu nhagu jojuweti ingobu ipija. <verse eid="JAS 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 2:3" />Ana muntendi isima ngani mundu jojuweti ingobu yeinyambiki jola nu kumpwagi: “Tama pamba pandu pasapi,” nu kumpwagi nhagu jola: “Wehapa jema kola,” au “Wehapa tama pai pambipi na magolu gangu.” <verse eid="JAS 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 2:4" />Boo, hogu nga ubagusi kati jino? Boo, na ganhamwi haga ngasegahuma mu mawasu giliya?<verse eid="JAS 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 2:5" />Mwaalongu bangu monumpai, nnzoannya! Boo, Sapanga ngasejuhangwi bandu babube ndi ahagu munndema gongo ili abiya bandu bana mali gingi mukuhobale nukujopa ukolongu waka Sapanga gojaalagila bandu ba bumpaile? <verse eid="JAS 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 2:6" />Lakini mwanganya mwaalongama bandu ahagula! Boo, bandu bana mali gingi nga lee babunhuni nu kumpeleka ku sengu? <verse eid="JAS 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 2:7" />Boo nga lee ba bilitondo liina li laamboni laka Kilisitu lebumpekie?<verse eid="JAS 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 2:8" />Ana nhenge lihengu Malagalaki gu ukolongu waka Sapanga ngati eahandiki mu Maandiku ga Sapanga: “Gumpala nzaku ngati eulipala wamwete,” mwibiya nhenga gaamboni ngani. <verse eid="JAS 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 2:9" />Lakini ana mwaabagwi bandu ndienu, nhenga mahakau nagombi malagalaki gantemula mwanganya kuba na makosa. <verse eid="JAS 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 2:10" />Jojukotoka kuhenga nhilu gumu wa Malagalaki, jiibiya na makosa gukukotoka kuhenga Malagalaki goti. <verse eid="JAS 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 2:11" />Ndaba ajolajo jojapwaga: “Witenda ugoni,” japwagiki kabee, “Wiikoma,” henu hata ana kwabii ngasegutei ugoni, lakini gukomiki, wehapa gukotwiki kujetake malagalaki goa. <verse eid="JAS 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 2:12" />Ndienu, mpwaaga nu kuhenga ngati bandu babiitemuliwa kwa Malagalaki gagaleta kulekekewa. <verse eid="JAS 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 2:13" />Ndaba Sapanga ngajikubi ni ikia pajantemula mundu jwanga ni ikia. Lakini mundu jojubii ni ikia ngajijogopi kutemuliwa.<verse eid="JAS 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kunhobale na mahengu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 2:14" />Mwaalongu bangu, boo, sanzangatiya ki mundu kupwaaga jubii nukuhobale, lakini ngasejulangi kwa mahengo? Boo, kuhobale je hoku kuwesa kunhokoa? <verse eid="JAS 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 2:15" />Tupwaaga ummbona nnzaku nndombu au nhasa ngasejubii ni ingobu wala posu. <verse eid="JAS 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 2:16" />Sanzangatiya kii mwanganya kwaapwaagi haba: “Nnzendannya su lukwali mwakanyata mwotu nu kutupi,” bila kaapeke gagapalika mu womi wabu. <verse eid="JAS 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 2:17" />Ahelahela, kuhobale kajika jaki bila mahengu, kuwile.<verse eid="JAS 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 2:18" />Lakini mundu juwesa kupwaaga: “Wehapa gubii nu kunhobale, nepani mii na mahengo!” Henu, “Nangiya mundu jojuwesa kunhobale bila mahengu, nanepani nagulangia kuhobale kwangu kukuhenga mahengu gangu.” <verse eid="JAS 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 2:19" />Boo, wehapa guhobale jubii Sapanga jumu? Ena! Lakini hata kilombu kihobale hela, na kabee kibagaja ku lujogopu. <verse eid="JAS 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 2:20" />Wehapa gung'ang'a! Boo, gupala lee kumanya kuhobale kutopu bila mahengu kukuwike? <verse eid="JAS 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JAS 2:21" />Boo, Ibulahimu ahoku bitu jawesa bo kujetakewa kuba jwaamboni palongi jaka Sapanga? Jajetakiwa ndaba ja mahengu gaki kipindi paampia litambiku mwanawaki Isaka panani ja mesa jukupikii litambiku. <verse eid="JAS 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JAS 2:22" />Gubweni, ndienu kuhobale kwaki na mahengu gaki gahenga lihengu pamu ndienu kuobale kwaki kwajaganiya kwa mahengu gaki. <verse eid="JAS 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JAS 2:23" />Hela gatimia Maandiku gaka Sapanga gagapwaga: “Ibulahimu anhobaliya Sapanga, na kukuhobale kwaki jajetakiwa kuba mundu jojetakiwi palongi jaki.” Ndienu Ibulahimu jwakemwa nkosi waka Sapanga. <verse eid="JAS 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JAS 2:24" />Mbweni, mundu jojujetakewa na Sapanga kwa mahengu gaki na nga kukuhobale kajika jaki.<verse eid="JAS 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JAS 2:25" />Kwabiya ahelahela kuku nselati Lahabu, jombi jajetakewa palongi jaka Sapanga ndaba jaajopa bandu baalaluki laluki ili kupata majambu ga nndema jela na kwajangati ajendannya kukupete indela na jengi.<verse eid="JAS 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JAS 2:26" />Ndienu mwaalongu bangu ngati nhyega bila loho jikuwike, ahelahela kuhobale bila mahengu kukuwike.<verse eid="JAS 2:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JAS 3" />
  <para style="s">Kululonda lulime</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 3:1" />Mwaalongu bangu, bingi binu biikuba aka abola, ngati emmanyiki twepani twakaabola twiitemuliwa ngani kupeta bangi. <verse eid="JAS 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 3:2" />Twepani twaboti tulikobando mu majambu gingi, lakini ana mundu ngasejukose pukulonge, nala hoju jutosane na juwesa kulongo nnhyega joti. <verse eid="JAS 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 3:3" />Twepani twaakonga milomu falasi kwa somasoma ni migoji ili butujetakia patwalongosa na kwi indela heji tuwesa kwaalongosa pokapi patupala. <verse eid="JAS 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 3:4" />Hata ngati sitima ngolongu ngani na jikangwa nu nhai nkali iwesa kung'anambuliwa ku nsukani nsoku ngani, nukujenda kwokapi kojupala jojuendesa sitima. <verse eid="JAS 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 3:5" />Ahelahela, lulimi hata ngati kiungu kisokopi sa nhyega, kilipuni majambu makolongu ngani.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JAS 3:5">Indanyu ya motu iwesa kujosa kitengu kikolongu. <verse eid="JAS 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 3:6" />Kabee lulimi lubii ngati mwotu. Gutweli ubaja gwingi, gubii na napwasi jaki mu nhyega jitu nu kuenesa ubaja mu mioju jitu, guhalabana womi witu gwoti kwa mwotu goguhuma ku Jehanamu. <verse eid="JAS 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 3:7" />Mundu juwesa kupuga inyama, juwesiki kupuga iumbi yoti, inyama imwikioli ni ijuni na inyama yeikwaba na iumbi yoti yu mmasi, nayombi iwesiki kupugwa na bandu. <verse eid="JAS 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 3:8" />Lakini nga mundu jojuwesiki kulongosa lulimi lwaki. Lulimi ndi sindu siliya, ngasekilongoseka na lutweli sumu jejikoma. <verse eid="JAS 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 3:9" />Kukupete lulimi twepani tunsengu Bambu na Atati bitu. Nu lulimi lolo twaalapi bandu, bandu babube baabombiki ku lilenganu laka Sapanga. <verse eid="JAS 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 3:10" />Malobi gu kupengale nu gukulapa gahuma mu ndomu gumu. Mwaalongu bangu, majambu haga ngasegapalika kuba hela. <verse eid="JAS 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 3:11" />Boo, kiliba simu kiiwesa kupia masi ga sapi na masi gagabii na mwinyo? <verse eid="JAS 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 3:12" />Mwaalongu bangu, boo nkongu wu ntini guwesa kupapa matunda gi Mizeituni au nzabibu guwesa kupapa tini? Kiliba masi gagabii na mwinyu ngasekiwesa kupia masi ga sapi.<verse eid="JAS 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malangu gagahuma kunani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 3:13" />Boo, nya jwana malangu nu umanyi kati jino? Nala, julangia lijambu leheli sukutama sapi na kwa mahengu gaki gaamboni gagahengeka sukulihulua na kwa malangu. <verse eid="JAS 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 3:14" />Lakini mioju jinu ana jitweli wipu nu kusuki nu usoju, nala mwakipuna nu kupwaga isoli nukukana usakaka nukulihenga mbii na malangu. <verse eid="JAS 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 3:15" />Malangu ngati haga ngasegahuma kunani kwaka Sapanga, malangu ge haga gahuma pani punndema na nga gaka Loho waka Sapanga ila gahuma kwiki lijobi. <verse eid="JAS 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 3:16" />Ndaba pokapi papabii na wipu na soju ndi pabii na puju na kila aina ju ubaja. <verse eid="JAS 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 3:17" />Lakini malangu gagahuma kunani kwaka Sapanga, gatumbuli oti kuba sapi gapala lukwali na gapala kulihulu na kwaajoane bandu; gatweli ikia na gabii na mahengu gaamboni na ngasegapala kwaabagu bandu na ngasegapala kulikopake kuba gaamboni. <verse eid="JAS 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 3:18" />Bandu baaleta lukwali apanda lukwali nu kuhusa ilebi yukujetakeka palongi jaka Sapanga.<verse eid="JAS 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JAS 4" />
  <para style="s">Ukosi nu nndema</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 4:1" />Boo, kukomana ni milomu joti kati jinu ihuma kwako? Boo, jihuma lee mu ndokule hinu iliya yeikomana nkati jino? <verse eid="JAS 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 4:2" />Ntokule hindu na ndaba ngasemwipata mmbi tayali kukoma, ntokule ngamaa kupata hindu, lakini ngasemwiipata, henu nndosana nu kukomana. Ngasempata sempala ndaba ngasemukiloba kwaka Sapanga. <verse eid="JAS 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 4:3" />Henu, panndoba ngasempata ndaba nndoba liyaa; nndoba ili mwitumia kwa ndokule hinu. <verse eid="JAS 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 4:4" />Mwanganya ndi mwabandu mwanga kuhobaleka ngati heabi agoni. Boo, ngasemmanyiki kuba akosi ba bandu bu nndema ndi akuba abaja baka Sapanga? Jokapi jojupala kuba nkosi wu nndema julihenga mbaja waka Sapanga. <verse eid="JAS 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 4:5" />Mwiholale kupwaga Maandiku gaka Sapanga galonge bwaka, pagapwaga, “Loho jojuwe Sapanga ammbei nkati jitu jubii na wipu nkolongu.” <verse eid="JAS 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 4:6" />Lakini, uamboni waka Sapanga gojutupeki gubii na makili ngani, ngati egapwaga Maandiku: “Sapanga jaapenga babikipuna lakini jaapeke uamboni babilihulu.”<verse eid="JAS 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 4:7" />Ndienu, nzetakiya kulongoswa na Sapanga, mulipenga Lijobi najombi jiitenda kutila. <verse eid="JAS 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 4:8" />Munhegaliya Sapanga, najombi janhegaliya mwanganya. Nngolula maboku ginu mommbi na mahakau! Nnyambisika mioju jinu mo mulikopake mwabandu baamboni! <verse eid="JAS 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 4:9" />Mmbiya nu usungu, nndela nu kulobalake; kiheku sinu kibiya kilelu; nu kutogule kwinu kubiya nu usungu nakanopi. <verse eid="JAS 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 4:10" />Mulihulua palongi jaka Bambu, najombi jiitenda kunkwea.<verse eid="JAS 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mabole gukukanaki kwaatemu bangi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 4:11" />Mwaalongu bangu, mwiipwagani majambu giliya mwabeni na beni. Joampwagi liyaa nnzaki nu kuntemu, hoju julipwagi mweni liya nukugatemu Malagalaki. Ana gutemwi Malagalaki, nala wehapa ngase ugajetake malagalaki, ila gutenda kugatemula. <verse eid="JAS 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 4:12" />Sapanga kajika jaki ndi jojubeka malagalaki nu kutemu. Najombi kajika jaki ndi jojuwesa kuokowa nukukoma. Ndienu, boo, wehapa ndi wanyanye mbaka untemula mundu jonge?<verse eid="JAS 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mabole gukukanaki kukipuna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 4:13" />Henu, nnzoannya mompwaga: “Lelenu au kilabu twiijenda ku musi gumu nu kutama hoku saka soti nu kulomba hindu nu kulombesa hindu nu kupata lupija lwingi.” <verse eid="JAS 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 4:14" />Mwanganya ngasemmanyiki hata kutama kwinu ekwibiya kilabu! Mwanganya ndi ngati likongobu lelihika muda nzipi pena nu kuboka kabee. <verse eid="JAS 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 4:15" />Mpalika kupwaga: “Bambu ana jupai twiitama nukuhenga senze au selase.” <verse eid="JAS 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 4:16" />Lakini henu mkipuna nu kulikwea; kukipuna kwa namuna heji ndi kuliya.<verse eid="JAS 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 4:17" />Nala, mundu jokapi jojumanyiki lijambu la amboni lejupalika kuhenga lakini ngasejuhenga, mundu we hoju juhenga mahakau.<verse eid="JAS 4:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JAS 5" />
  <para style="s">Kwaakanaki bandu bana mali gingi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 5:1" />Ndienu nzowana mwabandu mombii na mali gingi! Nndela nu kulobaleke ndaba ja mang'aliku ga ganhikila. <verse eid="JAS 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 5:2" />Hindu hinu itei kubola ni ingobu inu iotuliwi na mabongu gagakula ingobu. <verse eid="JAS 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 5:3" />Zahabu na madini ga feza imeliki kutu na kutu je heji jandangiya mwanganya pagwendu namuna embii na makosa, najombi jihalabana nhyega inu ngati mwotu. Mwanganya mlibeki mali gingi mu masoba ga mwisu gane. <verse eid="JAS 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 5:4" />Ngasemwaalepiki misalaa atumi babahengiki lihengu mu matui ginu. Nzoannya kung'ong'oteka kwabu! Kilelu sa bandu baahusa matui ginu kihikiki mu makutu gaka Bambu junu Uwesu. <verse eid="JAS 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 5:5" />Ntami pundema maisa gu kulilengane na ga ndokule. Mulinenapisi mwabeti mu lisoba lukujenda kusinzwa. <verse eid="JAS 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 5:6" />Mwaatemwi na kaakoma bandu banga na makosa, najombi ngasejumpengike!<verse eid="JAS 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kunhinakali mu mang'aliku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 5:7" />Ndienu, mwaalongu bangu nhinakaliya mbaka Bambu ejiihika. Nndingaliya mundu jojulema ejulendale sukuhinakali mimea jaki jipia ilebi yaki ya sapi. Jombi julendale sukuhinakali iyula ji kihuku nu msimu ukuhusa. <verse eid="JAS 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 5:8" />Mwanganya kabee mpalika kuhinakali, nngangamalisa mioju jinu, ndaba lisoba lu kuhika Bambu litenda kuhegali punndyangu.<verse eid="JAS 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 5:9" />Mwaalongu bangu, mwiiyomane mwabeni na mwabeni ili mwiitemuliwa na Sapanga. Jojutemu juegale kuhika. <verse eid="JAS 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 5:10" />Mwaalongu bangu, ana mpai kulingali lilenganu lukulendale nu kuhinakali mu mang'aliku, nhwasaliya alota baka Sapanga babube balongila ku liina laka Bambu. <verse eid="JAS 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 5:11" />Twaakema bandu baapengiwi ndaba batei kuhinakali. Nnzoini lijambu lukuhinakali kwaka Ayubu, na mmanyiki namuna Bambu ejunhengila pamwisu. Ndaba Bambu jutweli ikia na uamboni.<verse eid="JAS 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 5:12" />Kupeta haga goti, mwaalongu bangu, mwiilapa kupete kunani kwaka Sapanga, wala pundema wala sindu sengi sokapi. Mpwaga, “Ena” ana mpala kupwaga sakaka ena na “Ngahela” ana mpala kupwaga ngahela, na hapa ngamwiitemuliwi na Sapanga.<verse eid="JAS 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 5:13" />Boo, jubii mundu jokapi kati jino jojubii na mang'aliko? Jupalika kundoba Sapanga. Boo, jubii mundu jojutogulela? Jupalika kujemba nyembu yu kulumbalii. <verse eid="JAS 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 5:14" />Boo, jubii nngonzu kati jino? Jupalika kwaakema aseja bikikundi sa bandu ba bunhobali Kilisitu, nabombi bandobila nu kumpakii mahuta ku liina laka Bambu. <verse eid="JAS 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 5:15" />Ana alobiki su kuhobale nngonzu jitenda kulama; Bambu ampekia womi, na mahakau gajahengiki gitenda kulekakewa. <verse eid="JAS 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 5:16" />Ndienu, mpwagannya mahakau ginu mwabe kwa mwabe, na kila mundu andobila nzaki, ili mpata kulama. Kuloba kwaka mundu jwa jojujetakeka palongi jaka Sapanga kubii na makili na gahenga lihengu ana julobiki sukukasana. <verse eid="JAS 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 5:17" />Elia jabii mundu ngati twepani. Jaloba kwa mwoju iyula jiikuna, najombi ngasejakunike punndema kwa yaka itatu na miei sita. <verse eid="JAS 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 5:18" />Ndipala jaloba kabee, jakuna iyula kuhuma kunani nu nndema wapia ilebi.<verse eid="JAS 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 5:19" />Mwaalongu bangu, jumu winu ana juhobiki mu kuhobale nu kuguleka usakaka, ana jongi na ankelabwi kabee, <verse eid="JAS 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 5:20" />mmanya ana, mundu joankelabuki jojubii na mahakau kuhuma kwi indela jejahobi ja mahakau, jajiokua loho jaki kuhuma mu kuwa, na mahakau gitenda kuboka.<verse eid="JAS 5:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 5" />
</usx>